    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Trocpont-sur-V\u00e9z\u00e8re et Tourtour-les-Bains, deux petits villages du Sud de la France, se livrent depuis toujours une impitoyable guerre de clocher. Symbolis\u00e9e par un redoutable derby entre les deux \u00e9quipes de rugby, Trocpont a incontestablement pris l\u2019ascendant mais une arriv\u00e9e inattendue de demandeurs d\u2019asile va changer la donne et bouleverser la vie de ces deux villages.",
        "english": "Two villages in the south of France have always been bitter rivals, but when a group of asylum seekers arrive in the community, the life of both villages is shaken up and age-old disagreements escalate. Their antagonism reaches its peak with the annual rugby derby played between the two village teams, but this time, with the new outsiders joining as unexpected recruits, the result of the 100th match will be more unpredictable than ever."
